@Passage-Section Queueing model for computer networks
@Passage-Text He had thought about that problem, so I took his model and adapted it. Wrote up a proposal saying we are going to take a case where we have nodes that store, sort, correct, route.
@Passage-Context Kleinrock describes adapting James R. Jackson's queueing model to study how data moves through a computer network.
